strings.en:
Save the world, huh... Honestly, I don't
give a damn.{1a}But I won't die for nothin'. We got our
own pride.{0c:fe}

Think ya can do anything with arms that
skinny? As if a woman could do a man's
work...{0c:fe}

strings.jp:
でもよ、あの新聞の内容、
ちょっと大げさなんじゃねえのか?
とてもじゃねえが信じられねえよ。{0c:fe}

strings.read:
